WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.917
-OK, I'm in.
-Good.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.042
Now I just have to
pick the guy.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:19.167
You? No, no, no, no.
See, that's the fun part.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.375
Just so you don't make it
too easy on yourself,

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:22.542
we'll pick the loser.

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:23.833
Cameron, right?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.625
Yeah. Can I help you
with something?

00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:27.875
I'm Padgett.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.875
We were in Señora Parker's

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:31.542
Spanish class together,
remember?

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.542
Yeah, guess so.

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:35.083
Hola!

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.333
Hi.

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:37.792
Good times.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.208
Wait, where are you going?

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:43.750
I thought you were finished.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:47.042
Cameron!
What a weird coincidence.

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:49.458
Well,
I'm here every morning,

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:52.500
so I'm pretty sure
the only weird part is you.

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:53.500
Fair enough.

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:56.083
There's just so much of it.

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:58.542
What do horses eat anyway?

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.167
Well, that one, Jimbo over there,
he likes Chipotle.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.875
Gilly prefers sushi.

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:08.333
Seriously, more?

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:10.125
I'm just capturing
the moment.

00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:12.042
You can't enjoy this without
sharing it

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:13.250
with like 500 strangers?

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:16.417
Five hundred? Try 887,132.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.083
And they're not strangers.

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:19.542
-They're followers.
-Followers?

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:20.875
You mean like a cult?

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:25.625
Disgusting!

00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:27.917
Sorry!
I'm sorry for laughing.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.208
It's just I've never seen

00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:30.583
such an uncoordinated
dismount.

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:32.542
Aren't you captain
of the dance team?

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.708
What?
It's mostly grass, right?

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:41.458
You make me

00:01:41.542 --> 00:01:43.542
Feel like I'm livin'

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:45.375
A teenage dream

00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:47.333
All right, Kweller.

00:01:47.417 --> 00:01:49.875
I can't sleep

00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:52.708
Let's run away
And don't ever look back

00:01:52.792 --> 00:01:54.375
Don't ever look…

00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:56.208
-That's the bet guy.
-Yeah.

00:01:56.292 --> 00:01:57.667
Who is this guy?

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:01.333
When you look at me
Just one touch

00:02:01.417 --> 00:02:03.792
Now, baby, I believe

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:05.750
This is real

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.167
So take a chance
And don't ever…

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.542
They're actually
kind of good.

00:02:13.542 --> 00:02:15.250
Wait,
are you actually smiling?

00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:17.500
-What?
-I don't know.

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:19.292
I've just never
seen you like this.

00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:21.458
High school is just
a bunch of scared people

00:02:21.542 --> 00:02:23.500
pretending to be
something they're not.

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:38.667
We got our clothes
and we're done now, right?

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.875
Oh God, what now?

00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:44.208
You've done this before?

00:02:44.292 --> 00:02:45.833
Literally
thousands of times.

00:02:45.917 --> 00:02:47.667
Really?
You've shaved a guy's face?

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.708
Sorry! Can't hear you!

00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:14.458
Wow! You are good.

00:03:14.542 --> 00:03:16.000
How do you feel?

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:18.125
Like I just lost
Dancing with the Stars.

00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:21.000
Well,
if I didn't know any better

00:03:21.083 --> 00:03:22.917
and you weren't my brother,

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.833
I'd say you look pretty hot.

00:03:25.917 --> 00:03:26.917
Right, Padgett?

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:30.708
Yeah, sure.

00:03:31.208 --> 00:03:34.042
You know you could totally
make money at this, right?

00:03:34.125 --> 00:03:35.708
You know
I don't care about money.

00:03:35.792 --> 00:03:36.833
Or not, but…

00:03:36.917 --> 00:03:39.375
keeping your talent
locked away,

00:03:39.458 --> 00:03:40.792
what are you hiding from?

00:03:41.708 --> 00:03:43.917
You know, I could ask you
the same question.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.375
What are you talking about?

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:48.000
Well, I'm talking about…

00:03:48.583 --> 00:03:49.583
this.

00:03:51.208 --> 00:03:52.250
And…

00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:54.417
this.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.125
And these.

00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:00.083
Not the eyelashes,

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:01.542
they're glued on
pretty tight.

00:04:15.167 --> 00:04:18.292
I know this isn't usually
my style, obviously.

00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:21.542
But… what do you think?

00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:23.458
-I think yes!
-Sorry…

00:04:23.542 --> 00:04:26.042
I hate to interrupt
this adorable moment,

00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:27.125
but, Padgett,

00:04:27.208 --> 00:04:28.708
isn't there something
you should tell Cameron?

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:31.375
-Alden, what are you doing?
-Leave her alone, Alden.

00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:33.708
-Shut up, Quinn.
-What's going on?

00:04:33.792 --> 00:04:35.917
I made a bet with Alden

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.458
that I could take
some person and, and…

00:04:38.542 --> 00:04:40.750
-and make them over.
-Some person?

00:04:40.833 --> 00:04:42.083
What kind of person?

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:44.292
Can we please just talk
about this in private?

00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:45.625
What kind of person,
Padgett?

00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:47.167
The biggest loser
we could find,

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.750
so she could turn
him into prom king.

00:04:48.833 --> 00:04:50.667
-But that was before--
-Wait! So I was a bet?

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.333
-No--
-No, I was a fucking bet!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.167
You can all go to hell.

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:01.417
Someone special once told me

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.792
high school is just
a bunch of scared people

00:05:04.875 --> 00:05:07.333
pretending to be
something they're not.

00:05:07.417 --> 00:05:09.917
But it doesn't have
to be that way.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.125
That's the lesson
he taught me.

00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:15.792
I only wish I didn't have
to lose him to learn it.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.542
Whoa.

00:05:41.917 --> 00:05:42.833
Hey.

00:05:42.917 --> 00:05:44.292
I meant what I said.

00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:46.167
I'm gonna start being honest
about who I am.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.542
From now on, I swear.

00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:51.625
OK, well,
if we're being honest.

00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:53.542
There was one thing in your
speech that you got wrong.

00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:55.208
What was it?

00:05:55.292 --> 00:05:57.083
You never really lost me.

00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:02.125
Seriously?

00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:05.875
-I'm done with her.
-Thank you.

00:06:06.458 --> 00:06:08.000
Now, where were we?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.250
Yes! Woo-hoo! Finally!

